## 🧠 How It Works

The chatbot follows a simple rule-based architecture:

```text
User Starts Chat
       ↓
Enter Name
       ↓
Check Current Time
       ↓
Generate Greeting
       ↓
Ask for User Input
       ↓
Convert Input to Lowercase
       ↓
Search Predefined Keywords
       ↓
Matching Keyword Found?
     ↙       ↘
   Yes        No
    ↓          ↓
Return      Return
Response    Fallback
    ↓
Print Response
    ↓
Input Contains "bye"?
     ↙       ↘
   Yes        No
    ↓          ↓
  Exit      Continue
```

The response dictionary contains predefined phrases and their corresponding answers. The `getResponce()` function converts the user's input to lowercase and checks whether any stored key appears inside the input.

