## 🕐 Time-Based Greeting

The chatbot uses Python's `datetime` module to determine the current hour and select an appropriate greeting.

The current implementation categorizes the time into:

```text
05:00 - 11:59  → Good Morning
11:00 - 17:59  → Good Afternoon
17:00 - 20:59  → Good Evening
Other times    → Good Night
```

This allows the chatbot to provide a more contextual greeting when the conversation starts.

