## ⚙️ Getting Started

### Prerequisites

Make sure Python 3 is installed on your system.

Check your Python version:

```bash
python --version
```

or:

```bash
python3 --version
```

### Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/SumitGurjarTech21/AI_rule_based-chatbot.git
```

### Navigate to the Project

```bash
cd AI_rule_based-chatbot
```

### Run the Chatbot

```bash
python main.py
```

On systems where Python 3 is accessed through `python3`:

```bash
python3 main.py
```

